OL,3,GNEWSATrial date set for man accused of
OL,4,Awoman's murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA trial date has been set for a man
OL,7,Faccused of murder following the death
OL,8,Fof a woman in her 70s.
OL,10,FGerald Bishop, 73, was charged with
OL,11,Fmurder after the woman died after being
OL,12,Ffound with serious injuries on Friday
OL,13,Fat an address on Sherbourne Avenue in
OL,14,FBradley Stoke, on the outskirts of
OL,15,FBristol.
OL,17,FBishop appeared at Bristol Crown Court
OL,18,Fon Tuesday where a provisional trial
OL,19,Fdate was set for 5 April, 2027.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
